WEBVTT

28:31.361 --> 28:34.531
- It's too dangerous.
- Just for a moment.

28:34.656 --> 28:36.825
Until we know who our enemies are.

28:36.950 --> 28:39.035
I know they did it, Ned.
The Lannisters.

28:39.160 --> 28:41.037
In my bones, I know it.

28:41.162 --> 28:43.039
Littlefinger's right.

28:44.791 --> 28:46.960
I can't do anything without proof.

28:47.085 --> 28:49.587
And if you find the proof?

28:49.713 --> 28:51.756
Then I bring it to Robert...

28:51.881 --> 28:54.551
and hope he's still the man I once knew.

28:56.511 --> 28:58.471
You watch yourself on the road, huh?

28:59.514 --> 29:01.891
That temper of yours
is a dangerous thing.
